        <mxCell id="title" value="WMSD — Main Entities ERD" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="-40" width="600" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" value="Notation: PK = _id; FK = application-level reference (MongoDB does not enforce it). Document _id equals documentNo. items[] fields belong to embedded document lines. Line-level FKs point to an embedded row: defectHoldId → defect_reports.holds[]._id; dispatchLineId → transfer_dispatches.items[]._id. Both movements[] balance ids → inventory_balances (one edge). customer_returns sources may instead point to a historical external reference. Not drawn: items[].productId → products and items[].lotId → product_batches on every document; createdBy/approvedBy → users; stock_transactions.sourceId → the posting document." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="1420" width="440" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
